# Local environment. Vite's default only covers *.local; a bare .env would otherwise be
# committed. Nothing secret belongs in a VITE_ variable anyway — they are inlined into the
# bundle at build time and ship to every browser — but the brief requires config out of the
# repo, and .env.example is the file that documents it.
.env
